    <rigor-reason>Project-close orchestration: status flip, lessons-learned, mandatory `/test-diet` reconciliation gate (root §7), artifact archive, final holistic `code-review`, and final TASK-INDEX reconciliation. Writes project-close state + invokes gates — MUST run from the main session (root §3). STANDARD rigor with an explicit test-diet gate.</rigor-reason>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Main-session-only: runs the `/test-diet` gate, updates project-close state, and produces the final review after ALL work tasks complete. Cannot be delegated to a subagent (touches project-close state + gates; §3 write boundary).</parallel-reason>
