  <steps>
    <step order="1" name="Verify all tasks complete">Read `TASK-INDEX.md`; confirm every W0–W8 task is ✅ (or explicitly documented as deferred/owner-handoff). If any remain 🔲/🔄 unexpectedly, STOP and report.</step>
    <step order="2" name="README → Complete">Update the README status to Complete; summarize shipped W0–W8 scope + the 11 spec Success Criteria met.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Lessons-learned">Author `notes/lessons-learned.md` (ACS net-new experience, shared-path 040 + characterization guard, notification-spine R2 contract, ADR-026 Path-A surface, NFR-04 boundary, publish-size trajectory, deferred items).</step>
    <step order="4" name="/test-diet gate">Invoke `/test-diet`; produce `notes/test-diet-report.md` (MAINTAIN keep / SCAFFOLDING `git rm` / AMBIGUOUS reviewer-judgment). Do NOT auto-execute the emitted commands.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Archive">Run `/repo-cleanup` conventions: move ephemeral working/notes files to archive; retain permanent artifacts (spec, design, plan, tasks, arch docs, ADR-046).</step>
    <step order="6" name="Final code-review">Run a final holistic `code-review` across the R1 diff surface (special attention: 042 privacy, NFR-04 no-ACS-SDK); address Critical findings.</step>
    <step order="7" name="Reconcile + reset">Mark task 090 ✅ in `TASK-INDEX.md`; confirm full reconciliation; set `current-task.md` to "none — project complete".</step>
    <step order="8" name="Ready to merge">Confirm the project is complete and ready for `merge-to-master`; the wrap-up PR cites `notes/test-diet-report.md`.</step>
  </steps>

